No third-party AI agent code is bundled or vendored. The built-in VORTEX
Local Advisor is the only bundled advisor; the deterministic core and
Guardian remain the authority. Do not copy proprietary code into VORTEX.

The observe → typed action → host-state reward loop in `backend/episode.py`
is conceptually informed by Windows Agent Arena's POMDP task framing
(https://github.com/microsoft/WindowsAgentArena, MIT). No WAA source is
vendored; VORTEX executes reviewed Linux argv only.

The authorized remote-desktop window bundles noVNC (`@novnc/novnc`, MPL-2.0) as
a build-time dependency; it is inlined into the production document and is not
downloaded or executed from the network at runtime. No VNC or RDP server is
bundled or installed by Vortex Terminal.
